# Line endings: LF in the repo and in every working tree, whatever the OS,
# so a checkout copied between Windows and macOS/Linux never shows every
# file as modified. PowerShell scripts keep CRLF for Windows PowerShell.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.woff2 binary
